    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rotting Man | \u60aa\u81ed\u7537 is a psychological horror game that depicts a protagonist working as a clerk in a Japanese internet caf\u00e9.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, having entered university, begins working part-time at an internet caf\u00e9.<br>However, as they carry out their duties, strange and inexplicable events gradually begin to occur...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game set in Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a clerk at an internet caf\u00e9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations with various characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person walking simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in about 30 minutes to 1 hour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed entirely by a 16-year-old solo developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video uploads and live streaming are allowed without permission, regardless of individual or corporate use.<br>If possible, we would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in your video description.<br>RAYBIS GAMES takes no responsibility for any damages resulting from the posting or streaming of gameplay videos.<br>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rotting Man | \u60aa\u81ed\u7537 is a psychological horror game that depicts a protagonist working as a clerk in a Japanese internet caf\u00e9.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, having entered university, begins working part-time at an internet caf\u00e9.<br>However, as they carry out their duties, strange and inexplicable events gradually begin to occur...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game set in Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a clerk at an internet caf\u00e9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations with various characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person walking simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in about 30 minutes to 1 hour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed entirely by a 16-year-old solo developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video uploads and live streaming are allowed without permission, regardless of individual or corporate use.<br>If possible, we would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in your video description.<br>RAYBIS GAMES takes no responsibility for any damages resulting from the posting or streaming of gameplay videos.<br>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>",
